# Keymap edits stay in config/piantor_pro_bt.keymap

When the user asks to change "the keymap", they mean `config/piantor_pro_bt.keymap` only.

- Do not edit `config/piantor_pro_bt_5col.keymap` unless they name the 5-column map
- Do not change `boards/arm/**/*.keymap` or other files under `boards/` unless they explicitly ask to change board/firmware defaults
- Do not "keep copies in sync" between `config/` and `boards/`

```text
# BAD — 5-col map or board default
config/piantor_pro_bt_5col.keymap
boards/arm/piantor_pro_bt/piantor_pro_bt.keymap

# GOOD — the keymap they mean
config/piantor_pro_bt.keymap
```
